{"id":"9edaf01cf1","t":"The Abandoned Prince’s Ghost Bride","c":"cv","n":37,"l":37,"s":["ml","az"],"k":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride","az":"the-abandoned-prince's-ghost-bride"},"u":1795077250946,"desc":"في سنّ الثامنة، يُرغَم “لوسيان” على “الزواج” بروحٍ خفيّة والعيش في قصرها المسكون. وإشفاقً على لوسيان، تتولى تلك الروح الطهو والتنظيف له خفيةً، لتكتشف أنّه غدا قادًر على إبصارها فجأةً! وبمجرد تقاربهما، يُطلق “لوسيان” على عروسه الشبح اسم “ريا”، ويقطع لها عهًد بالزواج بها رسميًا ذات يوم. لكن ينجلي لاحقًا أن “لوسيان” أمير، ليُفرَّق شملهما بعد ذلك. وبعد انقضاء السنين، يعود العريس الصغير كإمبراطورٍ عتيد، متأهبً ليخلب لبّ عروسه الشبح أخيرًا.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["خيالي","رعاية طفل","رومانسى"],"src":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride","az":"the-abandoned-prince's-ghost-bride"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride|/manga/the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride/1/","az":"the-abandoned-prince's-ghost-bride|/series/the-abandoned-prince's-ghost-bride/chapter-1"},"2":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride|/manga/the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride|/manga/the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride|/manga/the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride|/manga/the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride|/manga/the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride|/manga/the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride|/manga/the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride|/manga/the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride|/manga/the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride|/manga/the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride/11/"},"12":{"ml":"the-abandoned-princes-ghost-bride|/manga/the-abandoned-prince